{
  "description": "Shared test vectors for the signed licence. token = 'v1.' + b64url(payload JSON) + '.' + b64url(signature); the signature is Ed25519 over the ASCII bytes of 'v1.' + b64url(payload JSON). base64url has no padding. Payload JSON field order: v, kid, typ, key_hash, store_id, product_id, variant_id, instance_id, iat, exp, reason (reason only when revoked), no whitespace.",
  "warning": "TEST KEYS ONLY. The seeds below are published throwaway keys and must never sign a real licence.",
  "key_format": "seed_b64 = base64 of the 32-byte Ed25519 seed (CryptoKit rawRepresentation). public_key_b64 = base64 of the raw 32-byte public key.",
